=== LRC14 Poincare-style symmetry ledger S172 ===
threshold delta=1/14

Worldline model
  runner i: x_i(t)=v_i*t on the time/phase cylinder
  danger tube: ||x_i(t)-x_observer(t)|| < delta
  safe time: a horizontal time slice misses every danger tube
  Poincare analogy: transformations are useful only after saying
    whether the observer worldline, integer lattice, and tube width are retained.

